{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"5c9e58a125e5e86a0f01c9a260ae3015f6da9a629c2301a3bec70568ce68aa6c","ja":"うん。だからあたしも、なにかできないか、\nSNSをいろいろ見てみたんだぁ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"cb4d284942a99e1e37439fe902c178018c8127a383d81ee9f10d28906e62900c","ja":"したっけ、みんないろんなこと書いてくれててねぇ。\nたとえばほら、こういうのとか。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
